 "response": {
  "text": "{\n  \"title\": \"Our understanding of the Trust's needs\",\n  \"text\": \"The Trust requires proposals to be submitted as one document of no more than 15 pages by e-mail to the Trust's office by 17:00 GMT on 2027-02-12 [REQ-0001]. The system must be live by 2027-06-30 and keep all personal data in the United Kingdom [REQ-0008, REQ-0012]. To support operations, the system shall hold donor records with contact details and gift histories [REQ-0003], track consent and the date given for e-mail, post, and telephone contact [REQ-0004], record volunteer hours per club [REQ-0005], and send volunteer reminders two days before booked sessions [REQ-0006]. Additionally, the system shall maintain 99% availability each calendar month [REQ-0010], and the supplier shall train Trust staff before go-live [REQ-0011]. The system should import existing donor spreadsheets without manual retyping [REQ-0007], and bidders may offer an optional mobile app for volunteers [REQ-0009].\",\n  \"cited_ids\": [\n    \"REQ-0001\",\n    \"REQ-0008\",\n    \"REQ-0012\",\n    \"REQ-0003\",\n    \"REQ-0004\",\n    \"REQ-0005\",\n    \"REQ-0006\",\n    \"REQ-0010\",\n    \"REQ-0011\",\n    \"REQ-0007\",\n    \"REQ-0009\"\n  ]\n}",
